#. ~ Description of "Epsilon Secure Container"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/secure_container.json
msgid ""
"A large secure storage.  This metaphysical container is unique in that it is "
"the only storage that will keep its contents on death.  Everything else will "
"still be lost."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Security Epsilon"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/secure_container.json
msgid ""
"You have come into possession of a large, ethereal storage container that "
"cannot be removed or destroyed.  It can hold 1500 mL and will bring items "
"back to the island with you, even when you die."
msgstr ""

